---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT x.a FROM (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM t WHERE b > 'm' GROUP BY a) AS x JOIN (SELECT d, count(*) AS m FROM u GROUP BY d) AS y ON x.n IS NULL"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner
   :- Aggregate [d#5], [d#5]
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [d#5]
   +- Aggregate [a#0], [a#0]
      +- Filter false
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
